<title>UK: ING Bank sets 3.0 bln FFR 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank sets 3.0 bln FFR 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers, Credit Agricole and ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    18.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.53     PAY DATE    18 JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    99.53     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX/PARIS/AMSTERDAM</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
